{"id":"forecast-03","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-03/audio-2.mp3","model":"small","duration":412.6,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":8.98,"text":"Part 2. You will hear the warden of a nature trail talking to a group of people who are interested in hiking on the trail.","words":[["Part",0.0,0.4],["2.",0.4,0.84],["You",2.06,2.3],["will",2.3,2.46],["hear",2.46,2.74],["the",2.74,2.98],["warden",2.98,3.48],["of",3.48,3.7],["a",3.7,3.84],["nature",3.84,4.08],["trail",4.08,4.52],["talking",4.52,5.34],["to",5.34,5.68],["a",5.68,5.82],["group",5.82,6.0],["of",6.0,6.18],["people",6.18,6.5],["who",6.5,6.88],["are",6.88,7.0],["interested",7.0,7.46],["in",7.46,7.78],["hiking",7.78,8.12],["on",8.12,8.52],["the",8.52,8.64],["trail.",8.64,8.98]]},{"start":10.06,"end":48.2,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 11 to 14. Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 14.","words":[["First",10.06,10.74],["you",10.74,10.96],["have",10.96,11.1],["some",11.1,11.26],["time",11.26,11.64],["to",11.64,11.86],["look",11.86,12.02],["at",12.02,12.18],["questions",12.18,12.5],["11",12.5,13.04],["to",13.04,13.32],["14.",13.32,13.82],["Now",44.62,44.94],["listen",44.94,45.26],["carefully",45.26,45.72],["and",45.72,46.06],["answer",46.06,46.46],["questions",46.46,46.84],["11",46.84,47.46],["to",47.46,47.7],["14.",47.7,48.2]]},{"start":51.81,"end":58.23,"text":"Good morning. I'm Susan Meyer, trail warden for the McFadden Hiking and Nature Trail.","words":[["Good",51.81,52.37],["morning.",52.37,52.75],["I'm",53.47,53.87],["Susan",53.87,54.21],["Meyer,",54.21,54.57],["trail",55.29,55.47],["warden",55.47,55.97],["for",55.97,56.17],["the",56.17,56.27],["McFadden",56.27,56.89],["Hiking",56.89,57.25],["and",57.25,57.57],["Nature",57.57,57.87],["Trail.",57.87,58.23]]},{"start":58.23,"end":65.67,"text":"trail. Let me tell you a bit about the trail. The trail is 25 miles long, running roughly","words":[["trail.",58.23,58.37],["Let",58.77,59.19],["me",59.19,59.35],["tell",59.35,59.59],["you",59.59,59.83],["a",59.83,60.09],["bit",60.09,60.21],["about",60.21,60.45],["the",60.45,60.63],["trail.",60.63,60.91],["The",61.91,62.31],["trail",62.31,62.63],["is",62.63,62.95],["25",62.95,63.51],["miles",63.51,63.89],["long,",63.89,64.41],["running",64.79,65.21],["roughly",65.21,65.67]]},{"start":65.67,"end":74.27,"text":"east to west. To hike it, you may start at either end of the trail or in between. You","words":[["east",65.67,66.19],["to",66.19,66.51],["west.",66.51,66.87],["To",67.91,68.23],["hike",68.23,68.47],["it,",68.47,68.73],["you",69.25,69.49],["may",69.49,69.67],["start",69.67,69.99],["at",69.99,70.35],["either",70.35,70.67],["end",70.67,70.99],["of",70.99,71.11],["the",71.11,71.23],["trail",71.23,71.59],["or",71.59,72.21],["in",72.21,72.47],["between.",72.47,72.73],["You",73.67,74.27]]},{"start":74.27,"end":80.69,"text":"can hike the whole length of the trail or just a couple of miles because there are 20 entry","words":[["can",74.27,74.47],["hike",74.47,74.75],["the",74.75,74.99],["whole",74.99,75.29],["length",75.29,75.63],["of",75.63,75.93],["the",75.93,76.05],["trail",76.05,76.41],["or",76.41,77.11],["just",77.11,77.43],["a",77.43,77.61],["couple",77.61,77.79],["of",77.79,77.99],["miles",77.99,78.39],["because",78.39,79.19],["there",79.19,79.59],["are",79.59,79.85],["20",79.85,80.31],["entry",80.31,80.69]]},{"start":80.69,"end":85.95,"text":"points along the trail, each connected to public roads by short paths.","words":[["points",80.69,81.13],["along",81.13,81.55],["the",81.55,81.87],["trail,",81.87,82.25],["each",82.67,83.13],["connected",83.13,83.53],["to",83.53,83.87],["public",83.87,84.17],["roads",84.17,84.63],["by",84.63,85.11],["short",85.11,85.45],["paths.",85.45,85.95]]},{"start":86.95,"end":93.29,"text":"For hikers coming from Johnson City, there's a shuttle bus to each of the two end points","words":[["For",86.95,87.71],["hikers",87.71,88.17],["coming",88.17,88.49],["from",88.49,88.77],["Johnson",88.77,89.15],["City,",89.15,89.61],["there's",90.11,90.47],["a",90.47,90.59],["shuttle",90.59,90.81],["bus",90.81,91.15],["to",91.15,91.61],["each",91.61,91.99],["of",91.99,92.17],["the",92.17,92.33],["two",92.33,92.57],["end",92.57,92.91],["points",92.91,93.29]]},{"start":93.29,"end":94.83,"text":"every morning and evening.","words":[["every",93.29,93.83],["morning",93.83,94.19],["and",94.19,94.49],["evening.",94.49,94.83]]},{"start":96.31,"end":101.83,"text":"And four of the entry points have a free car park with television camera surveillance.","words":[["And",96.31,96.69],["four",96.69,97.01],["of",97.01,97.17],["the",97.17,97.29],["entry",97.29,97.53],["points",97.53,97.95],["have",97.95,98.61],["a",98.61,98.83],["free",98.83,99.01],["car",99.01,99.25],["park",99.25,99.57],["with",99.57,100.19],["television",100.19,100.59],["camera",100.59,101.27],["surveillance.",101.27,101.83]]},{"start":102.83,"end":110.27,"text":"At one-mile intervals along the trail, there are rest stations providing picnic areas, water,","words":[["At",102.83,103.43],["one",103.43,103.69],["-mile",103.69,103.99],["intervals",103.99,104.65],["along",104.65,105.17],["the",105.17,105.51],["trail,",105.51,105.85],["there",106.33,106.63],["are",106.63,106.85],["rest",106.85,107.19],["stations",107.19,107.71],["providing",107.71,108.35],["picnic",108.35,108.95],["areas,",108.95,109.45],["water,",109.89,110.27]]},{"start":110.27,"end":115.25,"text":"toilets, and places where you can recharge your electronic devices.","words":[["toilets,",110.27,111.15],["and",111.69,112.13],["places",112.13,112.57],["where",112.57,112.89],["you",112.89,113.05],["can",113.05,113.25],["recharge",113.25,113.61],["your",113.61,114.07],["electronic",114.07,114.63],["devices.",114.63,115.25]]},{"start":116.13,"end":122.29,"text":"In response to a poll of walkers last year, we've recently installed kiosks at each","words":[["In",116.13,116.63],["response",116.63,116.93],["to",116.93,117.41],["a",117.41,117.59],["poll",117.59,117.85],["of",117.85,118.13],["walkers",118.13,118.57],["last",118.57,118.83],["year,",118.83,119.17],["we've",119.71,120.09],["recently",120.09,120.47],["installed",120.47,121.05],["kiosks",121.05,121.79],["at",121.79,122.05],["each",122.05,122.29]]},{"start":122.29,"end":127.15,"text":"rest station with clear, easy-to-follow maps and other trail information.","words":[["rest",122.29,122.55],["station",122.55,122.95],["with",122.95,123.55],["clear,",123.55,123.99],["easy",124.35,124.51],["-to",124.51,124.71],["-follow",124.71,125.03],["maps",125.03,125.47],["and",125.47,125.87],["other",125.87,126.19],["trail",126.19,126.51],["information.",126.51,127.15]]},{"start":128.65,"end":131.35,"text":"There are several distinct sections of trail.","words":[["There",128.65,129.05],["are",129.05,129.29],["several",129.29,129.69],["distinct",129.69,130.23],["sections",130.23,130.81],["of",130.81,131.11],["trail.",131.11,131.35]]},{"start":132.29,"end":139.41,"text":"The Red Rock Walk offers a superb opportunity to study a huge variety of vegetation along","words":[["The",132.29,132.59],["Red",132.59,132.83],["Rock",132.83,133.07],["Walk",133.07,133.43],["offers",133.43,134.23],["a",134.23,134.51],["superb",134.51,135.19],["opportunity",135.19,135.99],["to",135.99,136.33],["study",136.33,136.71],["a",136.71,136.95],["huge",136.95,137.41],["variety",137.41,137.91],["of",137.91,138.35],["vegetation",138.35,138.89],["along",138.89,139.41]]},{"start":139.41,"end":148.25,"text":"along the way. There's lots to look at, though you can't see great distances. Birds are actually","words":[["along",139.41,139.51],["the",139.51,139.65],["way.",139.65,139.89],["There's",140.95,141.63],["lots",141.63,141.93],["to",141.93,142.19],["look",142.19,142.39],["at,",142.39,142.69],["though",143.05,143.45],["you",143.45,143.75],["can't",143.75,144.21],["see",144.21,144.49],["great",144.49,144.83],["distances.",144.83,145.43],["Birds",146.73,147.23],["are",147.23,147.71],["actually",147.71,148.25]]},{"start":148.25,"end":155.79,"text":"hard to spot, but with a pair of binoculars and at certain times of day, you may see some","words":[["hard",148.25,148.61],["to",148.61,148.83],["spot,",148.83,149.31],["but",149.95,150.63],["with",150.63,150.87],["a",150.87,151.05],["pair",151.05,151.23],["of",151.23,151.39],["binoculars",151.39,152.09],["and",152.09,152.75],["at",152.75,152.91],["certain",152.91,153.21],["times",153.21,153.53],["of",153.53,153.75],["day,",153.75,154.07],["you",154.53,154.99],["may",154.99,155.17],["see",155.17,155.49],["some",155.49,155.79]]},{"start":155.79,"end":164.17,"text":"rare varieties. The Riverwalk comprises about five miles of trail winding along the bank","words":[["rare",155.79,156.09],["varieties.",156.09,156.69],["The",158.33,158.97],["Riverwalk",158.97,159.55],["comprises",159.55,160.47],["about",160.47,160.97],["five",160.97,161.57],["miles",161.57,161.91],["of",161.91,162.15],["trail",162.15,162.51],["winding",162.51,163.27],["along",163.27,163.57],["the",163.57,163.85],["bank",163.85,164.17]]},{"start":164.17,"end":171.49,"text":"of the Malder River. Personally, I prefer this section of the trail in winter. The","words":[["of",164.17,164.59],["the",164.59,164.73],["Malder",164.73,165.11],["River.",165.11,165.37],["Personally,",166.35,167.03],["I",167.59,167.89],["prefer",167.89,168.27],["this",168.27,168.65],["section",168.65,169.03],["of",169.03,169.23],["the",169.23,169.37],["trail",169.37,169.65],["in",169.65,169.93],["winter.",169.93,170.23],["The",171.19,171.49]]},{"start":171.49,"end":176.83,"text":"river does freeze over and the snow can accumulate, but that doesn't always","words":[["river",171.49,171.75],["does",171.75,172.05],["freeze",172.05,172.39],["over",172.39,172.79],["and",172.79,173.55],["the",173.55,173.83],["snow",173.83,174.15],["can",174.15,174.45],["accumulate,",174.45,175.01],["but",175.51,175.89],["that",175.89,176.09],["doesn't",176.09,176.43],["always",176.43,176.83]]},{"start":176.83,"end":182.33,"text":"discourage visitors. Sometimes though, if the weather conditions are really","words":[["discourage",176.83,177.55],["visitors.",177.55,177.93],["Sometimes",179.07,179.75],["though,",179.75,180.15],["if",180.51,180.75],["the",180.75,180.89],["weather",180.89,181.09],["conditions",181.09,181.65],["are",181.65,182.01],["really",182.01,182.33]]},{"start":182.33,"end":189.05,"text":"unsuitable, we might have to close this walk to the public. But often it can","words":[["unsuitable,",182.33,183.07],["we",183.57,183.95],["might",183.95,184.23],["have",184.23,184.45],["to",184.45,184.61],["close",184.61,184.89],["this",184.89,185.23],["walk",185.23,185.55],["to",185.55,185.77],["the",185.77,185.87],["public.",185.87,186.15],["But",187.37,188.05],["often",188.05,188.49],["it",188.49,188.85],["can",188.85,189.05]]},{"start":189.05,"end":192.91,"text":"get crowded with hikers who've discovered the attraction of the area.","words":[["get",189.05,189.23],["crowded",189.23,189.63],["with",189.63,189.91],["hikers",189.91,190.35],["who've",190.35,191.05],["discovered",191.05,191.45],["the",191.45,191.71],["attraction",191.71,192.23],["of",192.23,192.45],["the",192.45,192.57],["area.",192.57,192.91]]},{"start":196.29,"end":202.03,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 15-20.","words":[["Before",196.29,196.89],["you",196.89,197.17],["hear",197.17,197.41],["the",197.41,197.57],["rest",197.57,197.83],["of",197.83,197.95],["the",197.95,198.03],["talk,",198.03,198.35],["you",198.73,198.97],["have",198.97,199.15],["some",199.15,199.35],["time",199.35,199.75],["to",199.75,199.97],["look",199.97,200.13],["at",200.13,200.25],["questions",200.25,200.63],["15",200.63,201.43],["-20.",201.43,202.03]]},{"start":232.6,"end":235.8,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 15-20.","words":[["Now",232.6,232.9],["listen",232.9,233.18],["and",233.18,233.54],["answer",233.54,233.92],["questions",233.92,234.34],["15",234.34,235.14],["-20.",235.14,235.8]]},{"start":239.3,"end":245.54,"text":"Now let me tell you about the Halfway Hostel, located approximately midway along the trail.","words":[["Now",239.3,239.82],["let",239.82,240.04],["me",240.04,240.16],["tell",240.16,240.38],["you",240.38,240.56],["about",240.56,240.88],["the",240.88,241.14],["Halfway",241.14,241.62],["Hostel,",241.62,242.18],["located",242.56,243.06],["approximately",243.06,243.88],["midway",243.88,244.56],["along",244.56,245.0],["the",245.0,245.28],["trail.",245.28,245.54]]},{"start":246.34,"end":251.2,"text":"It has a range of facilities available to help make your walking experience memorable.","words":[["It",246.34,246.66],["has",246.66,246.82],["a",246.82,246.98],["range",246.98,247.22],["of",247.22,247.42],["facilities",247.42,247.82],["available",247.82,248.44],["to",248.44,248.96],["help",248.96,249.2],["make",249.2,249.46],["your",249.46,249.68],["walking",249.68,250.02],["experience",250.02,250.5],["memorable.",250.5,251.2]]},{"start":251.2,"end":256.3,"text":"available. Let me give you some information about the various facilities available there.","words":[["available.",251.2,251.46],["Let",251.92,252.48],["me",252.48,252.6],["give",252.6,252.8],["you",252.8,252.92],["some",252.92,253.12],["information",253.12,253.58],["about",253.58,253.94],["the",253.94,254.14],["various",254.14,254.48],["facilities",254.48,255.02],["available",255.02,255.92],["there.",255.92,256.3]]},{"start":257.34,"end":264.26,"text":"Of course there are beds in dormitories for use at a very reasonable $7 per person, weekdays","words":[["Of",257.34,257.82],["course",257.82,258.12],["there",258.12,258.34],["are",258.34,258.52],["beds",258.52,258.84],["in",258.84,259.1],["dormitories",259.1,259.74],["for",259.74,260.24],["use",260.24,260.5],["at",260.5,260.78],["a",260.78,260.86],["very",260.86,261.12],["reasonable",261.12,261.68],["$7",261.68,262.24],["per",262.24,262.88],["person,",262.88,263.32],["weekdays",263.66,264.26]]},{"start":264.26,"end":272.24,"text":"or weekends. Unfortunately we found that pre-booking beds just didn't work, so now we allocate","words":[["or",264.26,264.8],["weekends.",264.8,265.18],["Unfortunately",266.28,267.02],["we",267.02,267.44],["found",267.44,267.82],["that",267.82,268.14],["pre",268.14,268.62],["-booking",268.62,269.06],["beds",269.06,269.42],["just",269.42,269.88],["didn't",269.88,270.26],["work,",270.26,270.52],["so",270.86,271.26],["now",271.26,271.66],["we",271.66,271.86],["allocate",271.86,272.24]]},{"start":272.24,"end":277.98,"text":"them as people arrive, but we have extra cots and sleeping bags to help with any overflow.","words":[["them",272.24,272.58],["as",272.58,272.92],["people",272.92,273.2],["arrive,",273.2,273.64],["but",273.98,274.42],["we",274.42,274.6],["have",274.6,274.76],["extra",274.76,275.12],["cots",275.12,275.52],["and",275.52,275.7],["sleeping",275.7,275.96],["bags",275.96,276.34],["to",276.34,276.88],["help",276.88,277.14],["with",277.14,277.36],["any",277.36,277.52],["overflow.",277.52,277.98]]},{"start":279.0,"end":284.94,"text":"There are two family rooms accommodating six people each with private bathrooms.","words":[["There",279.0,279.84],["are",279.84,280.04],["two",280.04,280.32],["family",280.32,280.74],["rooms",280.74,281.2],["accommodating",281.2,282.26],["six",282.26,282.62],["people",282.62,283.0],["each",283.0,283.42],["with",283.42,283.96],["private",283.96,284.32],["bathrooms.",284.32,284.94]]},{"start":285.76,"end":294.54,"text":"They're $35 per room and for them you will need to make arrangements ahead of time as they're very popular, especially at the weekends.","words":[["They're",285.76,286.42],["$35",286.42,286.9],["per",286.9,287.64],["room",287.64,288.04],["and",288.04,288.8],["for",288.8,289.04],["them",289.04,289.2],["you",289.2,289.44],["will",289.44,289.6],["need",289.6,289.82],["to",289.82,290.0],["make",290.0,290.16],["arrangements",290.16,290.76],["ahead",290.76,291.16],["of",291.16,291.3],["time",291.3,291.64],["as",291.64,292.14],["they're",292.14,292.32],["very",292.32,292.54],["popular,",292.54,293.04],["especially",293.36,293.82],["at",293.82,294.12],["the",294.12,294.2],["weekends.",294.2,294.54]]},{"start":295.98,"end":303.54,"text":"A popular facility that we've recently added is coin-operated washing machines for your clothes.","words":[["A",295.98,296.64],["popular",296.64,297.08],["facility",297.08,297.72],["that",297.72,298.46],["we've",298.46,298.7],["recently",298.7,299.1],["added",299.1,299.56],["is",299.56,300.36],["coin",300.36,300.7],["-operated",300.7,301.48],["washing",301.48,301.92],["machines",301.92,302.52],["for",302.52,302.98],["your",302.98,303.12],["clothes.",303.12,303.54]]},{"start":304.4,"end":309.18,"text":"You can get awfully wet and dirty if you're walking the trail in bad weather,","words":[["You",304.4,305.0],["can",305.0,305.2],["get",305.2,305.38],["awfully",305.38,305.84],["wet",305.84,306.16],["and",306.16,306.38],["dirty",306.38,306.68],["if",306.68,307.32],["you're",307.32,307.48],["walking",307.48,307.78],["the",307.78,308.02],["trail",308.02,308.3],["in",308.3,308.56],["bad",308.56,308.88],["weather,",308.88,309.18]]},{"start":309.64,"end":315.3,"text":"and since we got these machines, you can put on clean gear when you set out in the morning.","words":[["and",309.64,310.08],["since",310.08,310.36],["we",310.36,310.6],["got",310.6,310.8],["these",310.8,311.02],["machines,",311.02,311.5],["you",312.08,312.28],["can",312.28,312.46],["put",312.46,312.7],["on",312.7,312.92],["clean",312.92,313.3],["gear",313.3,313.66],["when",313.66,314.18],["you",314.18,314.32],["set",314.32,314.56],["out",314.56,314.78],["in",314.78,314.94],["the",314.94,315.04],["morning.",315.04,315.3]]},{"start":316.44,"end":322.96,"text":"The hostel serves two meals a day, breakfast at $4 and dinner at $8,","words":[["The",316.44,316.88],["hostel",316.88,317.24],["serves",317.24,317.84],["two",317.84,318.24],["meals",318.24,318.5],["a",318.5,318.7],["day,",318.7,318.92],["breakfast",319.56,320.08],[